          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    
    <p class="text-content" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">If you're still deciding between private label and working from one of our base designs versus building a fully custom pattern from scratch, our <a href="/pet-clothing-manufacturer/private-label-pet-clothing/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">private label pet clothing guide</a> covers the cost and timeline difference in more depth.</p>
  </div>
